# --- Trained model artefacts ---
# The four serving artefacts (foriflow_model.pkl, scaler.pkl,
# shap_explainer.pkl, feature_names.json) ARE committed so a fresh clone
# scores with the real ensemble. Only the training log and the raw Kaggle
# CSVs stay out (see backend/README.md, "Training data").
backend/ml/train_log.txt
backend/ml/data/*.csv

# --- Capture / scratch ---
scripts/node_modules/
temp/
*.png.bak

# --- Screenshot/poster refresh tooling: local scratch only ---
# scripts/capture_auth2.py, scripts/render_poster.py,
# scripts/cleanup_test_applications.py and scripts/capture_swagger_only.py
# are the real, reusable tools and ARE committed. Everything below is
# generated while iterating on them: append-only run logs and thin
# double-click batch launchers, plus the superseded pre-fix capture script.
run-*.bat
install-playwright*.bat
capture-screenshots*.bat
*-log*.txt
commit-message*.txt
scripts/capture_auth.py
